    "detailed_description": "<div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/372efb30e472e9316ec7816f958db336.avif?t=1647912781\" /></div><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/04190d438f8040cbdd0a46e298685496.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/04190d438f8040cbdd0a46e298685496.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/04190d438f8040cbdd0a46e298685496.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Annihilate</strong> <strong>everything</strong> in your path using a variety of melee attacks and energy blasts. Upgrade your armor and acquire new abilities and power ups to decimate enemies as you fight to save your friend Alfred, the last of the powerful race know as 'Quantum ducks' from the clutches of Dr Bratwurst and his clumsy,<i> 'screw-up-everything'</i> minions. All the while you begin to realize the real villain is not who you first though and is <strong>FAR more powerful </strong>then you ever imagined..<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/372efb30e472e9316ec7816f958db336.avif?t=1647912781\" /></div><br>Explore a wide variety of beautiful full 3D landscapes that give an immersive sense of depth to a side-on world.<br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/0e0ff727ef93411497370a137d124173.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/0e0ff727ef93411497370a137d124173.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/0e0ff727ef93411497370a137d124173.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br>A blend of 3D and 2D environments  <br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/f6838010c335e577156810739521f9a4.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/f6838010c335e577156810739521f9a4.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/f6838010c335e577156810739521f9a4.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Destroy enemies with a variety of attacks and combos</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/05cd0bd2bc3ac02215ae213595e1e1b6.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/05cd0bd2bc3ac02215ae213595e1e1b6.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/05cd0bd2bc3ac02215ae213595e1e1b6.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A variety of cool vehicles to unlock and upgrade. Then enter your car into tons of different racing modes like destruction derby death race, bomb tag, bolder canyon, air time and more..</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/5511c14c39b83c211596525f20c9bd11.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/5511c14c39b83c211596525f20c9bd11.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/5511c14c39b83c211596525f20c9bd11.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Use 'finisher combos' to obliterate enemies\ud83d\udcaa\ud83d\ude08</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/e381bcb1b18e2fa55e7228e66cc1ee5c.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/e381bcb1b18e2fa55e7228e66cc1ee5c.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/e381bcb1b18e2fa55e7228e66cc1ee5c.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>Upgrade your suit with powerful and new abilities like quantum kick, Shock-wave and energy blast.</strong><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/d18770871cedf0d8f9590c4aeb94b395.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/d18770871cedf0d8f9590c4aeb94b395.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/d18770871cedf0d8f9590c4aeb94b395.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>A large cast of voice acted characters</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/67c9cfa5622e2ad2d4dcf8f18ece45e7.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/67c9cfa5622e2ad2d4dcf8f18ece45e7.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/67c9cfa5622e2ad2d4dcf8f18ece45e7.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><br><br>Slash, dash and blast your way through a variety of enemies and bosses.<br>Classic side-scrolling action, with a modern graphics upgrade.<br><br><strong>A 45\u00b0 player rotatable camera gives a unique sense of depth to a side-scrolling world.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/cd8981dfce2ea49be94b31512d0cd559.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/cd8981dfce2ea49be94b31512d0cd559.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/cd8981dfce2ea49be94b31512d0cd559.mp4?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></div><br><br><strong>3D open world areas to explore and enter races \ud83c\udfce\ud83c\udfce.</strong><br><div class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/88c27473a1c20a22fb7b44d7e175fbf3.poster.avif?t=1647912781\" ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/88c27473a1c20a22fb7b44d7e175fbf3.webm?t=1647912781\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/1721330/extras/88c27473a1c20a22fb7b44d7e175fbf3